{"id":"3169dc41990b4bbe","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-descriptive2-standard-borel-space.md","title":"ZFC Descriptive2 Standard Borel Space","display":"df-zfc-descriptive2-standard-borel-space — ZFC Descriptive2 Standard Borel Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-descriptive2-standard-borel-space","aliases":["58-df-zfc-descriptive2-standard-borel-space","58-df-zfc-descriptive4-standard-borel-space"],"display":"df-zfc-descriptive2-standard-borel-space — ZFC Descriptive2 Standard Borel Space","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-borel.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-polish-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-descriptive2-standard-borel-space"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-descriptive2-standard-borel-space</span><span>58-df-zfc-descriptive4-standard-borel-space</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-descriptive2-standard-borel-space — ZFC Descriptive2 Standard Borel Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9375de7089953a2b\" href=\"?note=9375de7089953a2b\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-borel.md\">../batch16/58-df-borel.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4b3a8629f6a6f868\" href=\"?note=4b3a8629f6a6f868\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-polish-space.md\">../batch17/58-df-polish-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> (underlying set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(\\mathcal B\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span> (measurable structure)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Polish}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Polish}_S\\)</span> (Polish-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4b3a8629f6a6f868\" href=\"?note=4b3a8629f6a6f868\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-polish-space.md\">../batch17/58-df-polish-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{StandardBorelSpace}\">\\(\\operatorname{StandardBorelSpace}\\)</span> (predicate defined below)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive2\\text{-}standard\\text{-}borel\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\operatorname{StandardBorelSpace}(X,\\mathcal B)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\tau\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Polish}_S(X,\\tau)\\land \\mathcal B=\\mathcal B(X,\\tau)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive2\\text{-}standard\\text{-}borel\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\operatorname{StandardBorelSpace}(X,\\mathcal B)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\tau\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Polish}_S(X,\\tau)\\land \\mathcal B=\\mathcal B(X,\\tau)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{StandardBorel}(X)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathcal B\\in V\\;\\operatorname{StandardBorelSpace}(X,\\mathcal B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{StandardBorel}(X)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathcal B\\in V\\;\\operatorname{StandardBorelSpace}(X,\\mathcal B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>二元谓词固定可测结构；为只传载体的原有下游调用补充一元存在结构投影，不改变二元定义。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-borel.md","status":"resolv